# --- Claude Code harness -------------------------------------------------
# The committed harness (.claude/settings.json, agents, skills, hooks, rules,
# workflows) IS tracked on purpose — it is shared team infrastructure.
# Only personal overrides and machine-local agent memory are ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/agent-memory-local/

# --- sPyNNaker auto-generated provenance ---------------------------------
# Not research output. 33 of these were committed by accident, and one
# stack_trace leaks an absolute dev path. Only `code/reports/` was ignored.
# To stop tracking the already-committed ones: git rm -r --cached reports/
reports/

# --- Knowledge vault + automation scheduling -----------------------------
# The knowledge/ vault is ITS OWN git repo with a private remote (nested; see
# knowledge/README.md). The parent repo ignores it entirely so daily digests
# never pollute the research repo's history.
knowledge/

# Scheduling: env.sh holds the API key; logs are per-run output. Never commit.
scripts/cron/env.sh
scripts/cron/logs/

# Improver draft branches live in an in-repo git worktree (kept inside the tree so the boundary
# hook allows it; the branch itself carries the changes). Never commit the worktree dir.
.worktrees/
